-- Applies the same ambient-lighting boost every model this project renders
-- during flight gets (per direct instruction: "increase the general
-- ambient light in all the systems") - see main/player_ship.script's own
-- AMBIENT_TINT for the full explanation of what this actually does to
-- model.material's shader and why `tint` is the only real lever. Used on
-- main/main.collection's accord_outpost/swarm_outpost instances - the
-- only rendered flight-scene objects with no other script of their own to
-- piggyback this onto (player_ship.script/asteroid_hub.script already
-- touch every ship hull/asteroid they spawn, so they just set this
-- directly instead of needing a copy of this file).
local AMBIENT_TINT = vmath.vector4(1.4, 1.4, 1.4, 1.0)

function init(self)
	go.set("#model", "tint", AMBIENT_TINT)
end
